  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (That could've gone better.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095229
    - rid: 1790118714061095230
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (If I had just interrupted {mc} earlier-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118714061095231
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Maybe he wouldn't've just left us like that.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857600
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: I dunno... he didn't seem very receptive, I'm not sure if that would've
      helped.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857601
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857602
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: If you're that worried about him, you could let the guards know to be
      looking out for him.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Maybe...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857603
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (But it's not like I want to arrest him-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857604
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Police aren't supposed to be solving mental health problems, after all!
      Ahaha...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857605
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (... in a funny sort of way, I guess that means {mc} finally fits in-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857606
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (You know, having a crippling mental health problem.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857607
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
